# Personal CV files — your real CV and its tailored outputs. The committed
# example templates (cv/*.example.*, cv/README.md, cv/generated/.gitkeep) are
# re-included below so the folder's structure ships without your data.
cv/master-cv.docx
cv/experience-notes.md
cv/generated/*
!cv/generated/.gitkeep

# Personal data — your own job listings and any backups. The spreadsheet is
# created automatically on first run; it should never be committed.
*.xlsx

# Local-only rescue copy of your real candidate profile (see README).
MY_PROFILE.backup.txt
